## Usage Example

```bash
# Set environment variables
export FINPARSE_TOKEN="your-firefly-token"
export FINPARSE_OPENAI_API_KEY="your-openai-key"

# Run categorization
finparse categorize --confidence-threshold 0.8 --model "gpt-4o-mini"
```

